; error: 5:14: '&' takes the address of a place: a variable, a field or an item of one, or what a pointer points to, and this is a length, worked out from the value, with no place of its own
; A length is worked out from the value, not kept in it, so it has no place.
task main()
    bind xs = [1, 2, 3]
    show(&xs.len)
fi
